{
  "quizModal": "<div id=\"quiz-modal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur-xs z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-lg sm:max-w-2xl w-full max-h-[92vh] flex flex-col shadow-2xl overflow-hidden animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-150\">\n            <!-- Modal Header (Tetap / Tidak Ter-scroll) -->\n            <div class=\"px-5 py-4 sm:px-5 sm:py-3 border-b border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between shrink-0 bg-white\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n                    <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-folder-plus\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 id=\"quiz-modal-title\" class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm sm:text-base\">Buat Paket Kuis Baru</h3>\n                </div>\n                <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"toggleModal('quiz-modal', false)\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1 rounded-lg transition\" title=\"Tutup Modal\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg\"></i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            \n            <form id=\"quiz-form\" onsubmit=\"saveQuiz(event)\" class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-0\">\n                <!-- Form Body (Area yang dapat di-scroll) -->\n                <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar p-5 sm:p-7 sm:pt-1 space-y-3.5 text-xs\">\n                    <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"edit-quiz-id\">\n\n                    <div>\n                        <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Judul Paket Ujian / Kuis <span class=\"text-rose-500\">*</span></label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"quiz-title-input\" required placeholder=\"Contoh: Asesmen Sumatif Akhir Semester Informatika\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none text-xs\">\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n                        <div>\n                            <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Jenis Soal <span class=\"text-rose-500\">*</span></label>\n                            <select id=\"quiz-type-input\" required class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none text-xs bg-white\">\n                                <option value=\"\">Pilih Jenis Soal</option>\n                                <option value=\"mc\">1. Pilihan Ganda (mc)</option>\n                                <option value=\"complex\">2. Pilihan Ganda Kompleks (complex)</option>\n                                <option value=\"cause_effect\">3. Sebab Akibat (cause_effect)</option>\n                                <option value=\"case_analysis\">4. Analisis Kasus (case_analysis)</option>\n                                <option value=\"matching\">5. Menjodohkan (matching)</option>\n                                <option value=\"essay\">6. Uraian / Esai (essay)</option>\n                                <option value=\"mixed\">Campuran (Kombinasi Soal)</option>\n                            </select>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Status Publikasi</label>\n                            <select id=\"quiz-status-input\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 outline-none text-xs bg-white\">\n                                <option value=\"ACTIVE\">Aktif (Tampil ke Siswa)</option>\n                                <option value=\"DRAFT\">Draf (Disembunyikan)</option>\n                            </select>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n                        <div>\n                            <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\" title=\"Berapa banyak soal yang dikerjakan siswa dari total soal di bank\">Soal Dikerjakan</label>\n                            <input type=\"number\" id=\"quiz-max-questions-input\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"0 = Semua Soal\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none text-xs\" title=\"Jumlah soal yang akan dikerjakan siswa (misal 25 dari 50 soal). Kosongkan atau isi 0 untuk mengerjakan seluruh soal.\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Durasi (Menit) <span class=\"text-rose-500\">*</span></label>\n                            <input type=\"number\" id=\"quiz-duration-input\" required min=\"1\" max=\"360\" value=\"60\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none text-xs\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n                        <div>\n                            <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Mata Pelajaran</label>\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"quiz-subject-input\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Informatika\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none text-xs\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Kelas</label>\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"quiz-class-input\" placeholder=\"Contoh: 7, 8, 9\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none text-xs\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n                        <div>\n                            <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Waktu Mulai</label>\n                            <input type=\"datetime-local\" id=\"quiz-start-input\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 outline-none text-xs\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Waktu Selesai</label>\n                            <input type=\"datetime-local\" id=\"quiz-end-input\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 outline-none text-xs\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Deskripsi / Petunjuk Pengerjaan</label>\n                        <textarea id=\"quiz-desc-input\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Tuliskan petunjuk pengerjaan ujian, ketentuan, atau catatan tambahan bagi siswa (opsional)...\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none text-xs custom-scrollbar resize-y\"></textarea>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n                        <!-- Token Akses -->\n                        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl space-y-2.5\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                <label class=\"block font-bold text-amber-950 text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-key text-amber-600\"></i>Token Akses Siswa\n                                </label>\n                                <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"generateQuizToken()\" class=\"btn-compact py-1 px-2.5 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg shadow-2xs transition\">\n                                    <small class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate text-[10px]\"></i> Acak Token\n                                    </small>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] pl-1 text-amber-900 font-medium mb-1\">\n                                    Kosongkan jika tidak ingin menggunakan token.\n                                </p>\n                                <input type=\"text\" id=\"quiz-pin-input\" maxlength=\"6\" placeholder=\"KOSONG = Tanpa Token\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-300 font-mono font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-800 uppercase focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 outline-none text-xs bg-white\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 text-[10px] text-amber-800\">\n                                <label class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 pl-1 cursor-pointer font-semibold select-none text-amber-900 shrink-0\" title=\"Token otomatis berganti tiap 10 menit dengan toleransi waktu\">\n                                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"quiz-pin-auto-refresh-input\" checked class=\"rounded rounded-full border-amber-300 text-amber-600 focus:ring-amber-500\">\n                                    <span>Otomatis ganti tiap 10 menit</span>\n                                </label>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Bagian Import Soal Massal -->\n                        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl space-y-2.5\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                <label class=\"block font-bold text-amber-950 text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-import text-amber-600\"></i> Import Soal (Word / Excel)\n                                </label>\n                                <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"openGuideFromQuizForm()\" class=\"btn-compact py-1 px-2.5 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg shadow-2xs transition\" title=\"Buka dialog unduh template resmi Word & Excel\">\n                                    <small class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-download text-xs\"></i> <span>Template</span>\n                                    </small>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] pl-1 text-amber-900 font-medium mb-1\">\n                                    Soal Format (.docx, .doc, .xlsx)\n                                </p>\n                                <input type=\"file\" id=\"quiz-file-import-input\" accept=\".docx, .doc, .xlsx, .xls, .csv, .txt\" class=\"w-full text-xs text-slate-500 file:mr-2.5 file:py-1 file:px-2.5 file:rounded-lg file:border-0 file:text-[11px] file:font-semibold file:bg-amber-100 file:text-amber-800 hover:file:bg-amber-200 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-1 bg-white\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Modal Footer (Tetap / Tidak Ter-scroll) -->\n                <div class=\"px-5 py-3.5 sm:px-5 sm:py-3 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 flex items-center justify-end gap-2 shrink-0\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"toggleModal('quiz-modal', false)\" class=\"btn-compact border border-slate-300 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100\">Batal</button>\n                    <button type=\"submit\" id=\"btn-save-quiz\" class=\"btn-compact bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold shadow-2xs\">Simpan</button>\n                </div>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </div>",
  "qmDialog": "<div id=\"qm-dialog\" class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur-xs z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-xl w-full p-5 space-y-4 shadow-2xl animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-150\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center border-b pb-3\">\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm leading-tight\">${escapeHtml(quiz.title)}</h3>\n                                <p id=\"qm-count\" class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">${(quiz.questions || []).length} soal terdaftar</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('qm-dialog').remove()\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg\"></i></button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"qm-questions-list\" class=\"max-h-80 overflow-y-auto space-y-2 custom-scrollbar\">\n                            ${buildQuestionsListHtml(quiz)}\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"pt-2 flex justify-between items-center border-t\">\n                            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"openQuestionModal('${quiz.id}')\" class=\"btn-compact bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-xs\">\n                                <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus text-xs\"></i> <span>Tambah Soal</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('qm-dialog').remove()\" class=\"btn-compact border border-slate-300 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50\">Selesai</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>",
  "questionModal": "<div id=\"question-modal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur-xs z-[60] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full p-6 space-y-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar shadow-2xl animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-150\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-pen-to-square\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 id=\"question-modal-title\" class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm\">Tambah Soal Baru</h3>\n                </div>\n                <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeQuestionModal()\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg\"></i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <form id=\"question-form\" onsubmit=\"saveQuestion(event)\" class=\"space-y-3.5 text-xs\">\n                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"q-quiz-id\">\n                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"q-index\">\n                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"q-existing-image\">\n                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"q-image-action\">\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n                    <div>\n                        <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Bentuk / Tipe Soal <span class=\"text-rose-500\">*</span></label>\n                        <select id=\"q-type-select\" onchange=\"renderQuestionEditorFields()\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 outline-none text-xs bg-white font-bold text-slate-800\">\n                            <option value=\"mc\">1. Pilihan Ganda (mc)</option>\n                            <option value=\"complex\">2. Pilihan Ganda Kompleks (complex)</option>\n                            <option value=\"cause_effect\">3. Sebab Akibat (cause_effect)</option>\n                            <option value=\"case_analysis\">4. Analisis Kasus (case_analysis)</option>\n                            <option value=\"matching\">5. Menjodohkan (matching)</option>\n                            <option value=\"essay\">6. Uraian / Esai (essay)</option>\n                            <option value=\"short_answer\">7. Isian Singkat (short_answer)</option>\n                            <option value=\"scaled\">8. Skala Likert (scaled)</option>\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Lampiran Gambar (Opsional)</label>\n                        <input type=\"file\" id=\"q-image-input\" accept=\"image/png, image/jpeg, image/jpg\" onchange=\"handleQuestionImageSelect(event)\" class=\"w-full text-xs text-slate-500 file:mr-2 file:py-1 file:px-2.5 file:rounded-lg file:border-0 file:text-[11px] file:font-semibold file:bg-slate-100 file:text-slate-700 hover:file:bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-1\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Preview Gambar -->\n                <div id=\"q-image-preview-container\" class=\"hidden p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-700\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-image text-brand-600 mr-1\"></i> Preview Gambar:</span>\n                        <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"removeQuestionImage()\" class=\"text-rose-600 hover:text-rose-800 font-bold text-[11px]\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash-can mr-1\"></i> Hapus Gambar</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-center bg-white p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-100\">\n                        <img id=\"q-image-preview\" src=\"\" alt=\"Preview Gambar\" class=\"max-h-40 object-contain rounded\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Pertanyaan / Instruksi Soal <span class=\"text-rose-500\">*</span></label>\n                    <textarea id=\"q-text-input\" rows=\"3\" required placeholder=\"Tuliskan teks pertanyaan soal...\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none text-xs\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Container Dinamis Opsi / Pasangan / Isian -->\n                <div id=\"q-type-specific-container\" class=\"space-y-2 p-3 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-200\">\n                    <!-- Dynamic Fields -->\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <label class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Pembahasan / Penjelasan (Opsional)</label>\n                    <textarea id=\"q-explanation-input\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Penjelasan atau kunci pembahasan saat hasil dibuka...\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none text-xs\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"pt-3 flex justify-end gap-2 border-t\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeQuestionModal()\" class=\"btn-compact border border-slate-300 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50\">Batal</button>\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-compact bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold\">Simpan</button>\n                </div>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </div>",
  "massImport": "<div id=\"modal-mass-import\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/70 backdrop-blur-xs z-[95] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-xl w-full p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-150\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n                    <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm sm:text-base\">Download Template Soal & Panduan Format</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\">Mendukung Microsoft Word (.docx, .doc) dan Microsoft Excel (.xlsx)</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeMassImportModal()\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg\"></i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Download Templates -->\n            <div class=\"bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 space-y-3\">\n                <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-download text-amber-600\"></i> Pilih Berkas Template Resmi untuk Diunduh:\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"downloadWordTextTemplate()\" class=\"btn-compact py-2.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-100 border border-blue-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold transition shadow-2xs\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-word text-base text-blue-600\"></i> <span>Template Word (.doc)</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"downloadExcelTemplate()\" class=\"btn-compact py-2.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold transition shadow-2xs\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-excel text-base text-emerald-600\"></i> <span>Template Excel (.xlsx)</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/80\">\n                    <p class=\"font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-info text-brand-600\"></i> Ketentuan Format Penulisan:</p>\n                    <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-500 text-[11px] pl-1\">\n                        <li>Mendukung seluruh bentuk soal: Pilihan Ganda (mc), Pilihan Ganda Kompleks (complex), Sebab Akibat (cause_effect), Analisis Kasus (case_analysis), Menjodohkan (matching), dan Uraian / Esai (essay).</li>\n                        <li>Gambar dapat langsung disisipkan (paste) di dalam dokumen Word/Excel dan otomatis disimpan ke server.</li>\n                        <li>Pada dokumen Word, pisahkan setiap butir soal menggunakan tiga tanda strip (<code>---</code>).</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"pt-3 flex justify-end border-t\">\n                <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeMassImportModal()\" class=\"btn-compact bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold px-5\">Tutup</button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
}